</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dec10040-8d35-11f1-bac3-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/HOl13IfbsAA6mMI.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/dec10040-8d35-11f1-bac3-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/HOl13IfbsAA6mMI.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">911c7424-937e-11f1-9fbb-5155ff284042</guid><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 23:47:15 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>安德烈</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻解说</category><title>委内瑞拉朝野重启谈判　美国斡旋下寻求政治过渡</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%B4/20260807-%E5%A7%94%E5%86%85%E7%91%9E%E6%8B%89%E6%9C%9D%E9%87%8E%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E8%B0%88%E5%88%A4-%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%96%A1%E6%97%8B%E4%B8%8B%E5%AF%BB%E6%B1%82%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E8%BF%87%E6%B8%A1</link><description>
